powermon (0.2.1-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * plot: bars grow from a zero baseline; with mixed signs (battery charging
    and discharging) negative bars hang below a labelled zero line.
  * svg: dashed zero line for mixed-sign series.
  * stats: honours --width (or the terminal width); below 100 columns it
    drops the description column and wraps the battery-life estimate.

